event: thinking
data: {"id": "5e3201d93a144201-thinking-parallel_evidence-2524", "run_id": "5e3201d93a144201", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据kubectl describe的结果，Pod处于Pending状态，原因是ConfigMap \"unavailable-config\" 不存在，导致Volume挂载失败。这就是ContainerCreating状态的直接原因。\n\n关于之前失败的日志查询，错误信息显示是尝试访问monitor命名空间中的elasticsearch-master-0 Pod时被拒绝权限。这是因为query_pod_logs工具试图通过observability命名空间的service account去执行monitor命名空间中的Pod命令，存在权限限制。\n\n现在我需要分析这个Pod的实际状态：\n\n1. Pod状态是Pending而不是ContainerCreating\n2. 根本原因是ConfigMap \"unavailable-config\" 不存在\n3. 由于Pod没有成功启动，没有运行中的容器可以查询日志\n\n让我尝试直接获取Pod的YAML来确认配置：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788418052011, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "5e3201d93a144201-thinking-parallel_evidence-2525", "run_id": "5e3201d93a144201", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_start", "tool_name": "kubectl_get_yaml", "content": null, "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788418052013, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "entity": {"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-03", "name": "workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w"}, "dimension": "kubernetes"}, "tool_call_id": "call_842a1220c98b45e0ae408f9e", "tool_sequence": 2}

