data: {"id": "5e3201d93a144201-thinking-parallel_evidence-2846", "run_id": "5e3201d93a144201", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "完美，现在我有了完整的证据链：\n\n## 分析总结\n\n**实体身份确认：**\n- Pod: workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w\n- Namespace: aiops-case-03  \n- 当前状态: Pending (不是ContainerCreating)\n- Phase: Pending\n\n**根因证据：**\n1. **直接原因**：Pod依赖的ConfigMap \"unavailable-config\" 不存在\n2. **事件证据**：kubectl describe显示23次FailedMount事件，明确指出 \"configmap 'unavailable-config' not found\"\n3. **配置证据**：Pod YAML确认volume \"input\" 引用configMap \"unavailable-config\"\n4. **验证证据**：kubectl describe ConfigMap unavailable-config -n aiops-case-03 返回NotFound\n\n**关于日志查询失败：**\n- 失败原因是权限问题（mon", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788418057960, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

