data: {"id": "5e3201d93a144201-final", "run_id": "5e3201d93a144201", "seq": 2851, "ts_ms": 1788418076519, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w 的 Volume 'input' 引用了 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'，该 ConfigMap 在命名空间 aiops-case-03 中不存在，导致 Kubelet 挂载卷失败，Pod 持续处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes (fact-bbbbd09ae6a3) | `Warning FailedMount MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 确认根本原因：Kubelet 尝试挂载 Volume 'input' 时，在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中找不到 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes (fact-038709986883) | `Warning FailedMount Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition` | 描述挂载失败的连锁反应：由于依赖的 ConfigMap 缺失，导致卷挂载操作超时，Pod 卡在此阶段。 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes (fact-4e9d0b36ba9b) | `container: app, reason: ContainerCreating` | 反映 Pod 的实际运行状态：由于卷挂载失败，容器无法进入 Running 状态，停留在创建等待阶段。 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-020992003e70) | `PodScheduled: True, Initialized: True, Ready: False, ContainersNotReady` | 排除调度与网络层故障：Pod 已成功调度且容器初始化开始，但核心容器未就绪，定位问题至容器级资源（卷）挂载。 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus (fact-67c0329299f2) | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 量化现象：监控指标直接验证了应用容器因等待卷挂载而处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态的持续情况。 |\n| 6 | Topology | failed tool attempts | `Command failed (exit 1): kubectl get ... configmap unavailable-config ... Error from server (NotFound)` | 补充事实：通过直接查询确认该 ConfigMap 确实不存在于集群中，排除了资源名拼写错误或延迟生效的可能。 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nK8s 事件明确指出了 Volume 挂载失败的直接对象是缺失的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` (证据 #1, #6)。K8s 状态与指标相互印证，展示了该错误导致容器无法启动而长期停留在 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态 (证据 #2, #3, #5)。Pod 的 `PodScheduled: True` 状态排除了调度与节点可用性故障，将问题锁定在应用配置依赖层面 (证据 #4)。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 缺失 → Volume 'input' 挂载失败 → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态 → 应用不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：\nPod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 的 Volume 定义中引用了 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，但该资源在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中不存在。\n\n**证据支撑**：\nKubelet 日志中反复出现的 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` 错误（证据 #1），配合 `kubectl` 查询返回 `NotFound` 的事实（证据 #6），确凿地证明了配置依赖的缺失是引发挂载失败与容器启动停滞的根本原因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 32.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 74.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w: 74.3s (Evidence 67.2s, RCA 6.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w**: pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 117.836, "metrics": {"run_id": "5e3201d93a144201", "mttr": {"value": "2.0m", "seconds": 117.83865475654602, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-sandbox-create-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 117838.65475654602, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 107412.48321533203, "tool_calls": 18, "executed_tool_calls": 18, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 18, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 22537.92643547058, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 9922.504186630249}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 32137.287616729736, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 74274.66058731079, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11399.937629699707, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

